  description
    "The dense (short-tuple) representation of the monitor's evaluation function and the verified
     dense evaluator udmstep/udeval over it, with the window structures it runs. Monitor_Code_Dense is the code export the shipping binary is built
     from (src/verified.ml), together with the verified log parser of session Log_Parser;
     Log_Monitor composes the two, from the bytes of the log to the verdicts, and
     Log_Monitor_Online states its correctness for the online interface."
